  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat the smoker to 225°F (110°C).",
    "2. Season the barramundi fillets with salt and pepper.",
    "3. Smoke the barramundi for 30 minutes.",
    "4. Meanwhile, heat the gochujang, soy sauce, brown sugar, garlic, ginger, and red pepper flakes in a saucepan over medium heat.",
    "5. Add the bokkeum sauce to the saucepan and stir to combine.",
    "6. Add the smoked barramundi to the saucepan and coat with the sauce.",
    "7. Serve the smoked barramundi with steamed vegetables and garnish with chopped green onions.",
    "8. Drizzle sesame oil over the dish and serve immediately.",
    "9. Garnish with additional green onions and serve with steamed rice or noodles.",
    "10. Enjoy!"
  ],
